{"annotations":{"destructiveHint":false,"idempotentHint":true,"openWorldHint":true,"readOnlyHint":true,"title":"Find journals for a manuscript"},"description":"Find journals to submit a manuscript to: paste the abstract (or title and abstract) and get the journals that published the most similar papers in recent years, from OpenAlex. Each journal comes with its publisher, ISSN, how many similar papers it published (with examples), whether it is fully open access, whether it is in DOAJ and MEDLINE, the APC OpenAlex lists, two-year mean citedness, h-index, yearly output, and flags worth checking (no ISSN, stopped publishing, output that tripled in a year, open access but not in DOAJ). Quartiles (Q1\u2013Q4) are NOT included and must not be stated from memory: each result has an `sjr` link (Scopus quartile) and an `mjl` link (Web of Science) where the user reads them. Flags are reasons to check, never a verdict that a journal is predatory. A website listed here is not verified: hijacked journals copy real ones, so the journal is best reached from its publisher, DOAJ or SJR page. Pass `keywords` with English words when the abstract is not in English.","execution":{"taskSupport":"forbidden"},"inputSchema":{"$schema":"http://json-schema.org/draft-07/schema#","additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"abstract":{"description":"The abstract, or the title on the first line followed by the abstract.","maxLength":6000,"minLength":40,"type":"string"},"keywords":{"description":"English search keywords. Recommended when the abstract is not in English.","maxLength":200,"type":"string"},"max_apc_usd":{"description":"Leave out journals whose listed APC is above this.","maximum":20000,"minimum":0,"type":"number"},"max_results":{"default":12,"description":"Number of journals, 1\u201315.","maximum":15,"minimum":1,"type":"integer"},"open_access_only":{"default":false,"description":"Only fully open-access journals.","type":"boolean"},"years":{"default":3,"description":"Search papers fro